WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.270
Warm many plastics and, before
long, they start to soften.

2
00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:08.870
Warm them a little more, and you can
mould them into a brand-new shape.

3
00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:11.590
Something inside the
plastic is giving way.

4
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:15.050
Is it the chains themselves,
or something else?

5
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.650
When a plastic softens in
heat, what is breaking?

6
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.410
In this mission, you'll
find out what a polymer is,

7
00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:25.690
and how alkene molecules join
into long chains by addition.

8
00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:27.030
You'll draw repeating units,

9
00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:31.210
and work back from a polymer to
the monomer it was made from.

10
00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:35.710
Your mission: explain what happens
inside a plastic as it softens.
